<description>&lt;p&gt;Separatist leader Lucas Ayaba pleaded not guilty to war crimes charges in Norway, keeping international legal focus on the Anglophone conflict. Boko Haram insurgents have resurfaced in northern Cameroon, adding a new security threat to the region. In a remote national park, a Swiss tourist was killed by elephants and a British and an American hiker were wounded, while other hikers hid in a tree stump for hours. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92TUw0ZHByeWdBYktVZHVxWURiQWFqU1V4RlNoaWd5STJmWkh1OXVpV05pQzJKU3F3b09uOFdGclRra0tGVlluR29IeUZ1S1lTMGFvM0NyN2NUTnZiOUHSAWNBVV95cUxNXzZxVWc5SDdlelRTRUE0YlpWRWlITkVkRmV4eWJlSGszSnRwQUZ4V1k5cHZ5WkM4Z1Z3RHBQM2RSZVNiYlNQMllfZ1NoYmctX0JWSnUxdXJRWFVIMUlDckplY1U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQY1VJeVBkOGZYd051WVFES01ZTU01cW90enN3cTFILUtrZTk1WUNaSFRHRU5XU0hXYnh6UDQyRmVnQzBRZVlLX1FGWWdlbktIRVRKY2o2ZldyLVUxdFlfQTVTUmtpN0tKX0FiUkhKblRERHJIWGUxeFlXQTlhYU9TbXo4SlMtLWEtRHVielBMeGlvTDVGaXowNlo3cWplZ1hr?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOOWZ2dGc0VlRvMHJRLXlwX2JmVmc2SVdvbVpMU09OUlFmY1pzUmthazdxVnc4OXAtdVNvNVF1bkE0Tk5jR1l3RDM5ODQ3NThOZGpHX3JWR1FLdnpBd0xBSGd4R2plTlAxZzF4X2pERXphRTFJUjNIYlFoMW5qMDdRZVUwZU00cTVhRTR6azZxT0F5cHFqaXd5LXFqU085b2FTS2dUSzhHdkFlbXp1SnBnMGRQX3ZSQk0w?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQeHp6d3lKMzV0RWJZWkptNWpvOC1VUWo2bjdMMWRTMng2bHVuNG0yYXVyNEVyRFpaN1pHUGVZUUtCRDU2NUxTY3BWdjU2bEc3LTRBMktVclBmcjBpWWcyaW9JZ